<title>ITALY: FAO 1996 world wheat production forecast unchanged.</title>
<headline>FAO 1996 world wheat production forecast unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.N. Food and Agriculture Organisation (FAO) said on Thursday its latest forecast for 1996 world wheat production was 571.5 million tonnes, virtually unchanged from its previous forecast in June.</p>
<p>It said the figure was some 4.8 percent up from the revised estimate of production in 1995.</p>
<p>FAO said that while there had been downward revisions to estimates of wheat output in several countries in Asia and Europe, this had been offset by increased forecasts in North America and the southern hemisphere. --Rome newsroom 00 39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
